{"repositoryId":1426459799,"availability":"available","full":"cruciblephp/hallmark","name":"hallmark","description":"A PSR-3 logger for PHP 8.3+, with Monolog's handlers, formatters and processors, and Monolog's output.","category":"Other","language":"PHP","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-20T03:38:18Z","updated":"2026-10-20T03:48:23Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://cruciblephp.github.io/hallmark/","topics":["handler","log","logger","logging","monolog","psr-3","psr-log"],"demo":"https://cruciblephp.github.io/hallmark/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T05:24:11.397Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-20T05:24:11.397Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-20T05:24:11.397Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T05:24:11.397Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-20T05:24:11.397Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A PSR-3 logger for PHP 8.3+, with Monolog's handlers, formatters and processors, and Monolog's output.","Hallmark\\Logger implements Psr\\Log\\LoggerInterface. Levels are an enum, records are readonly, and its only dependency is psr/log. The level values, the JSON and the dates match Monolog's, so tools that read Monolog's logs read these too. Laravel gets a hallmark log driver.","The manual is in docs/, and the site is cruciblephp.github.io/hallmark. Every PHP sample in this README and in the manual runs in the test suite."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cruciblephp/hallmark/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3ed7673db1288b9a4493dc9dfc745027414382607c33414e3db7e7b7f1610b04","extractedAt":"2026-10-20T05:24:11.397Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T05:24:11.397Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A PSR-3 logger for PHP 8.3+, with Monolog's handlers, formatters and processors, and Monolog's output.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cruciblephp/hallmark/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"3ed7673db1